<title>USA: Arris names financial officer.</title>
<headline>Arris names financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH SAN FRANCISCO, Calif 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arris Pharmaceutical said it named Fred Ruegsegger as chief financial officer of the company.</p>
<p>Ruegsegger, who was formerly president and chief executive officer of EyeSys Technologies Inc replaces Dan Petree, who has held that position since 1994 and was recently promoted to executive vice president, corporate development.</p>
<p>As chief financial officer, Ruegsegger will have responsibility for facilities, finance and administration of Arris.</p>
